Appendix G — Proof of Theorem 7.2 (MTCU Extraction Consistency)

G.1 Setup

Let A be the architecture graph. Let \mathcal{C} be the set of candidate subgraphs. Let \mathcal{M} be the set of MTCUs satisfying Definition 3.6.

G.2 Algorithm

Algorithm G.1 (MTCU Extraction).

```
Input: Trained agent π, environment E, observation dims O, budget N
Output: MTCU set M

1. O_causal = IBD(π, E, O, N)
2. For each candidate subgraph m ⊆ A:
