Algorithm J.2 — Coupled Recombination (R1)

```
Input: G_A = (P_A, C_A, L_A), G_B = (P_B, C_B, L_B); θ_R = (k, coupling_rule)
Output: G_R or REJECT

1. Partition P_A, P_B into k blocks
2. For j = 1..k:
